  "tier": "2b",
  "domain": "bake_map/position",
  "description": "Tier 2b bake golden of phase3.4_baker-position (decision 384) on the analytic fixture bevelled-cube: the bevelled cube with highs matched by name: chamfered cube, knob under an _ignorebf cover, unmatched decoy (CaseMatchByName). Painter bakes Position at 512 px (OutputSize 9, DilationWidth 0, FilterMethod By mesh name, RelativeScale False, MaxHeight 0.05, MaxDepth 0.04; Position Mode All axis, Position Normalization BBox, Position NormalizationScale Per Material; every other baking parameter at Painter's default; normal map format OpenGL, tangent space the project default). The baked maps are exported as PNG 16 and OpenEXR 32f, padding passthrough, no dithering; recorded twice (same session; after save and reopen). Bake backend uncontrolled.",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "input_id": "bevelled-cube-low",
      "kind": "mesh",
      "path": "parity/fixtures/tier2b-bakes/bevelled-cube-low.obj",
